{"4869310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PINBOMB", "steam_appid": 4869310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/17be16dc3fa98c44702310ded109f5aa.poster.avif?t=1786713193\" width=780 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/17be16dc3fa98c44702310ded109f5aa.webm?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/17be16dc3fa98c44702310ded109f5aa.mp4?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Install upgrades, rip out old ones, and rebuild the machine every run. PINBOMB transforms pinball into a roguelike, and you into a pinball GOD!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/5af20325a9688ced112d427d80bdbe35.avif?t=1786713193\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras_big/5af20325a9688ced112d427d80bdbe35.webp?t=1786713193 width=1560 height=319 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade the machine by installing physical parts directly onto the board. Mix and match them to create an endless number of unique combinations. Start simple. Experiment. Improve. Dominate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/65109be9c116b80991092c8d1e8d8eb6.poster.avif?t=1786713193\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/65109be9c116b80991092c8d1e8d8eb6.webm?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/65109be9c116b80991092c8d1e8d8eb6.mp4?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/23c7fc93b68df02286ea325c31086e17.avif?t=1786713193\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras_big/23c7fc93b68df02286ea325c31086e17.webp?t=1786713193 width=1560 height=319 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for ordinary bumpers when you can have ship cannons, Tesla coils, conveyor belts, and gumball machines? In PINBOMB, every part changes the machine. Combine them to create wildly different builds, each with its own strengths, synergies, and playstyle. Experiment, adapt to every challenge, and reap the rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/113872f312c322e445e488bf62a00a79.poster.avif?t=1786713193\" width=780 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/113872f312c322e445e488bf62a00a79.webm?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/113872f312c322e445e488bf62a00a79.mp4?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/abe2227068ba0f6218dab272a49a9a33.avif?t=1786713193\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras_big/abe2227068ba0f6218dab272a49a9a33.webp?t=1786713193 width=1560 height=319 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your favorite part falling behind? Make it stronger and flashier with rank-ups, enchantments, mods, and customizations, then watch it carry the run again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/d5c480b67206825e9a31133ae5aba7eb.poster.avif?t=1786713193\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/d5c480b67206825e9a31133ae5aba7eb.webm?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/d5c480b67206825e9a31133ae5aba7eb.mp4?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/7154112989bbe23cb5de960cbe3fef13.avif?t=1786713193\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras_big/7154112989bbe23cb5de960cbe3fef13.webp?t=1786713193 width=1560 height=319 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ unique and handmade pinball machine parts, custom balls, active abilities, enchantments, and customizations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock starting boards with different layouts and starting parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth run structure containing branching paths with different bosses, optional content, and extra challenges.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install rare parts left behind by bosses to summon them. Beat the fight to claim their legendary upgrades. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional escalating difficulty levels for players who want to put their skills to the test. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school visuals, flashing lights, and juicy feedback that inject dopamine straight into your eyeballs.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/17be16dc3fa98c44702310ded109f5aa.poster.avif?t=1786713193\" width=780 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/17be16dc3fa98c44702310ded109f5aa.webm?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/17be16dc3fa98c44702310ded109f5aa.mp4?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Install upgrades, rip out old ones, and rebuild the machine every run. PINBOMB transforms pinball into a roguelike, and you into a pinball GOD!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/5af20325a9688ced112d427d80bdbe35.avif?t=1786713193\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras_big/5af20325a9688ced112d427d80bdbe35.webp?t=1786713193 width=1560 height=319 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade the machine by installing physical parts directly onto the board. Mix and match them to create an endless number of unique combinations. Start simple. Experiment. Improve. Dominate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/65109be9c116b80991092c8d1e8d8eb6.poster.avif?t=1786713193\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/65109be9c116b80991092c8d1e8d8eb6.webm?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/65109be9c116b80991092c8d1e8d8eb6.mp4?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/23c7fc93b68df02286ea325c31086e17.avif?t=1786713193\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras_big/23c7fc93b68df02286ea325c31086e17.webp?t=1786713193 width=1560 height=319 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for ordinary bumpers when you can have ship cannons, Tesla coils, conveyor belts, and gumball machines? In PINBOMB, every part changes the machine. Combine them to create wildly different builds, each with its own strengths, synergies, and playstyle. Experiment, adapt to every challenge, and reap the rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/113872f312c322e445e488bf62a00a79.poster.avif?t=1786713193\" width=780 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/113872f312c322e445e488bf62a00a79.webm?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/113872f312c322e445e488bf62a00a79.mp4?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/abe2227068ba0f6218dab272a49a9a33.avif?t=1786713193\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras_big/abe2227068ba0f6218dab272a49a9a33.webp?t=1786713193 width=1560 height=319 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your favorite part falling behind? Make it stronger and flashier with rank-ups, enchantments, mods, and customizations, then watch it carry the run again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/d5c480b67206825e9a31133ae5aba7eb.poster.avif?t=1786713193\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/d5c480b67206825e9a31133ae5aba7eb.webm?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/d5c480b67206825e9a31133ae5aba7eb.mp4?t=1786713193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras/7154112989bbe23cb5de960cbe3fef13.avif?t=1786713193\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/extras_big/7154112989bbe23cb5de960cbe3fef13.webp?t=1786713193 width=1560 height=319 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ unique and handmade pinball machine parts, custom balls, active abilities, enchantments, and customizations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock starting boards with different layouts and starting parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth run structure containing branching paths with different bosses, optional content, and extra challenges.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install rare parts left behind by bosses to summon them. Beat the fight to claim their legendary upgrades. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional escalating difficulty levels for players who want to put their skills to the test. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school visuals, flashing lights, and juicy feedback that inject dopamine straight into your eyeballs.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Pinball Roguelike! PINBOMB traps you in a room with a pinball machine hungry for higher and higher scores. Buy new parts to upgrade it, build wild synergies to feed the machine, and send your score through the roof. Oh, and there's a bomb strapped to it, so score big or go boom!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/5970c024c0ccbb53280a46900759561ae51acb06/header.jpg?t=1786713193", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/7cc9445a5cbe06e9857f968acb493a7c6f30b685/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786713193", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869310/7cc9445a5cbe06e9857f968acb493a7c6f30b685/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786713193", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 3rd generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 3rd generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, 